      "message": "Was there a specific reason to re-use `FP_POSITIVE_MATCH_SECRET_BYTES`, other than that it is the correct size? I think it would be clearer if we created a new `#define` specifically for the OTP key size (e.g., `OTP_KEY_SIZE_BYTES`).",
