      "message": "It seemed like the most appropriate #define and was used in the fpsensor_crypto code, updated to OTP_KEY_SIZE_BYTES. I had to use #define rather than const uint32_t \u003d to avoid a compilation error:\n\"variable length array folded to constant array as an extension [-Werror,-Wgnu-folding-constant]\n   80 |         uint8_t otp_key_buffer[OTP_KEY_SIZE_BYTES] \u003d { 0 };\"",
